{"reviews":[{"id":"B00UJ90JXA-0","r":4.0,"t":"Smaller than expected but will fit the bill","x":"This is smaller than I imagined it would be; I was hoping the barrel would be a little larger for bigger curls.  But it does a good job of curling under the ends of my shoulder length hair so I'm going to keep it.  I'm taking a 9 day trip with just carry on luggage, so space will be at a premium.  I won't be able to do my whole head with this in any reasonable time but it will be good enough to add a little body.  You have to work with small strands since the clamp is pretty small.  I bought a 6","h":19,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2017"},{"id":"B00UJ90JXA-1","r":5.0,"t":"I live in Sunny Florida and like to get to work early and take a long ...","x":"I live in Sunny Florida and like to get to work early and take a long walk.  By the time I return the humidity has plastered my bangs to my forehead.  This is such a wonderful and handy item to have in my drawer so I can turn it on and fix my bangs at work!","h":18,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2017"},{"id":"B00UJ90JXA-2","r":5.0,"t":"Perfect little curling iron","x":"Perfect little curling iron. Such a cute, feminine color as well.(I got the pink).Lightweight, swivels 360 degrees. Can easily be packed in your purse or travel bag.Heats up fast and cools down fast. Has a small edge to prop on so it does not burn counter or table..Perfect price. You can't go wrong . Hope this helps","h":17,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2019"},{"id":"B00UJ90JXA-3","r":5.0,"t":"Works great even for me","x":"I love this curling iron. I have short hair and am styling-challenged but the small size makes it easy to use, and I\u2019ll take it traveling with me. The low price made it pretty risk free. I recommend it.","h":14,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2019"},{"id":"B00UJ90JXA-4","r":5.0,"t":"Great little curling iron","x":"I got this for my daughter for Christmas. She was begging for a mini curling iron. We tried it out together and it did a better job than any of the other curling irons I own. The curls stayed for a long time. I am going to order another one for me.","h":13,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2017"},{"id":"B00UJ90JXA-5","r":5.0,"t":"It\u2019s very compact in size.","x":"This curling iron is the perfect size for vacation. It is very small so I had to adjust to such a tiny iron. But I have fine hair so someone with thicker hair might have a problem.  I really loved its size for travel. I had a heat sensitive pocket to put it in when it was still hot. And off we went. It fits anywhere.","h":11,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2018"},{"id":"B00UJ90JXA-6","r":5.0,"t":"Works great for International travel.","x":"I used this in Iceland and Scotland and it worked like a champ. It doesn't have a switch, like most things do, to go from 110 to 240v so I was a little nervous but it worked just fine. This is a travel size curling iron so it won't be as big or as perfect as a regular size professional iron but it worked pretty good and got me very close to what I usually get out of a curling iron. I have long, medium thick hair and had no problems. The clamp isn't as tight as it could be, my only complaint, but","h":10,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2017"},{"id":"B00UJ90JXA-7","r":1.0,"t":"I loved the fact that it was small","x":"I loved the fact that it was small, and light weight, BUT it\u2019s really no good to me as I just wanted to curl my bangs, but the clip that\u2019s on it that holds your hair on the barrel, isn\u2019t strong enough to hold my hair on it.  If the clip was a bit stronger it would be perfect","h":10,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2018"},{"id":"B00UJ90JXA-8","r":5.0,"t":"Really like this for cruising!","x":"I brought this along on a cruise ship. Not only did it save my hairdo on both days that I did and did not wash my hair, it fit in the little drawer at our vanity table when not in use.","h":9,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2017"},{"id":"B00UJ90JXA-9","r":5.0,"t":"Heats perfectly","x":"Best part of this iron is it is easy to carry anywhere. Curls perfectly. Price is also reliable. Doesn't take long to heat up.","h":9,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2019"},{"id":"B00UJ90JXA-10","r":5.0,"t":"Great little hair curler","x":"Great little hair curler for travel. Hair curler arrived quickly and in a nice box too. Heats quickly, has one heat setting. I think it could be used for short hair or taming the ends of long hair. I love it. 5 stars!!","h":8,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2018"},{"id":"B00UJ90JXA-11","r":3.0,"t":"Cute but faulty.","x":"I really liked this little curling iron when it came.  The size was perfect for packing in my suitcase, the color was fun, and the clamp to hold the hair for curling was nice and tight.  Unfortunately, it didn't heat up at all.  I had to return it.  I may try another one though, because, aside from not working,  it was exactly what I want in a travel curling iron.","h":5,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2017"},{"id":"B00UJ90JXA-12","r":5.0,"t":"Five Stars","x":"Perfect size for travel and also 110/220.  It does the job!","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2016"},{"id":"B00UJ90JXA-13","r":5.0,"t":"Nice to take with you.","x":"Great to pack for a short trip. heats up fast.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2018"},{"id":"B00UJ90JXA-14","r":5.0,"t":"Best purchase this year!!!","x":"I bought this for our trip to Europe this month. It works fabulously !! I have super thick, middle of the back length hair. I like to add some curls to the ends just to give it some bounce and body. This tiny iron did the job. Heats up fast. Curled my ends, 3-4 rotations, few seconds and done! Curls are holding nice. Shoot this little baby almost works better than my everyday one! Highly suggest you purchase if traveling anywhere. Of course I used a converter in Europe!","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2019"},{"id":"B00UJ90JXA-15","r":5.0,"t":"Good","x":"I'm taking it on a trip to Europe. Says it has dual voltage.  Price to performance seems adequate.  I used it once and I have fine hair and it held fine for me","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2018"},{"id":"B00UJ90JXA-16","r":1.0,"t":"Don\u2019t spend your money on these","x":"It did not clamp evenly on hair, which made it very hard to get enough compression to get a decent curl. Not made well at all, sorry!","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2019"},{"id":"B00UJ90JXA-17","r":5.0,"t":"Great for travel","x":"This was great for travel... worked very well and stayed hot throughout curling my hair.  Pleased with the purchase","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2019"},{"id":"B00UJ90JXA-18","r":4.0,"t":"Great little curling iron","x":"This is tiny and perfect! It gets hot, but not hot like a salon curling iron. It's perfect for what I need it for!","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2019"},{"id":"B00UJ90JXA-19","r":5.0,"t":"Easy to handle and not get burnt!","x":"Good things come in small packages... This sure did!","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2019"},{"id":"B00UJ90JXA-20","r":4.0,"t":"Pleasantly surprised!","x":"Really great little curling iron for travel. I would purchase again. The only thing that would make it 5 star is a better electrical plug. It looks kind of cheesy. I make sure to never leave it plugged in after I'm done using.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2019"},{"id":"B00UJ90JXA-21","r":5.0,"t":"Good for traveling!","x":"I have this which was given to me by my friend. It's cute. I have short to medium length hair and works great on me. I always bring it when travelling/vacation.","h":1,"v":0,"d":"Jun 2019"},{"id":"B00UJ90JXA-22","r":5.0,"t":"Small but mighty","x":"Just perfect for cruising or adding style to your every day hair!!! So easy to use , pack & work. Love it.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2019"},{"id":"B00UJ90JXA-23","r":5.0,"t":"Small","x":"Love it ! It\u2019s small But really puts out the heat , I\u2019m buying 2 more for my girls for stocking stuffers","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2018"},{"id":"B00UJ90JXA-24","r":5.0,"t":"Great traveling piece","x":"Great traveling item. Works really good for being small","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2019"}],"emb":"","summary":{"claims":[{"text":"Reviewers frequently praise its compact size and portability for travel, packing easily in purses, suitcases, and carry-on luggage.","cites":[1,3,6,9,10,13,14]},{"text":"Many note it heats up quickly and works well for curling ends and bangs.","cites":[3,10,11,14,15]},{"text":"Several reviewers consider it a great value at a low, risk-free price.","cites":[3,4,10]},{"text":"Some mention the small barrel size requires adjustment and may not suit thicker hair.","cites":[1,6,7]},{"text":"A few report issues with the hair clip not holding well or the unit failing to heat up.","cites":[8,12]}]},"qa":[]}